OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-car crash shuts stretch of
OL,4,AStratford route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-vehicle crash in
OL,7,FStratford-upon-Avon has shut part of
OL,8,Fthe A439.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fscene on Monday at 17:45 BST with
OL,12,Fpolice officers remaining at the scene
OL,13,Fon Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe A439 Warwick Road is shut from the
OL,16,FMarraway roundabout to its junction
OL,17,Fwith Ingon Lane and Sandbanks Lane.
OL,19,FWarwickshire Police said the road was
OL,20,Flikely to remain closed for some time
OL,21,Fwith drivers being advised to use
OL,22,Falternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
